      {
        "id": 89706,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-19T19:12:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>About Writhe. You know the Sentinel Character cards all form a single picture with their background? Well...3 of them anyway. Writhe is clearly the odd man out.&nbsp;</p><p>He totally goes mad, loses control of his cloak and it consumes him by the bell tower as Argent Adept (assumingly) tries to keep him in check (like he did for naturalists sudden transformations).&nbsp;</p><p>I wonder if a promo for the sentinels will exclude Writhe in some way, if there ever is one at all.&nbsp;</p>",
