      {
        "id": 89707,
        "name": "Envisioner",
        "username": "Envisioner",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-19T19:17:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;I like how the Sentinels characters can each be semi-equated to two members of the Fantastic 4.</p><p>Writhe = part Mr. Fantastic (science and stretchy powers), part Thing (dark and tormented).</p><p>Mainstay = part Thing (big strong guy), part Torch or Sue (hotheaded/protective).</p><p>Medico =&nbsp; part Torch (energy powers), part Sue (caring healer).</p><p>Idealist = part Sue (conjures forcefields), part Mr. Fantastic? (creative genius).</p><p>These are kind of a guess since I haven't seen the deck, not too sure on Mainstay and Iddy's personalities (Medico and Writhe seem fairly obvious from the bio).</p>",
