        "created_at": "2014-02-21T18:41:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;I wonder if a promo for the sentinels will exclude Writhe in some way, if there ever is one at all.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I think far too many of the cards in the Sentinels' deck reference Writhe by name to have a promo set that don't include him.</p>",
