        "created_at": "2015-03-10T00:35:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Writhe originally took to crime after the \"cloak\" took him over, so it is likely Tachyon is the one that took him down before he joined the rest of the Sentinels while in prison. &nbsp;</p>",
